{"title": "Inagentiy", "pageid": 2099, "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Inagentiy</b> is Robert's massive horse from <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a>. Pavel states that Robert created Inagentiy, out of Shadows, fusing into the beast the strength and speed of a hurricane and a pile driver. Robert once had a man wear Pavel's castoff garments and torment the beast.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"notice metadata plainlinks\" id=\"stub\"><i>This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_stubs\" title=\"Category:Article stubs\">stub</a>. You can help Amberpedia Wiki by  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://princeofamber.fandom.com/wiki/Inagentiy?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></div></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260501231351\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 336/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.636      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    2.636      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.1_prod_princeofamber:pcache:idhash:2099-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260501231351 and revision id 4334. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>", "sections": [], "links": [{"ns": 14, "title": "Category:Article stubs", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Shadow", "exists": true}], "url": "https://amber.fandom.com/ru/wiki/Inagentiy"}